{"run_id": "10f39a7784d94f97936fa5b56357039f", "sequence": 4, "time": "2026-10-29T16:40:18.882539+00:00", "event": "tool_result", "call_id": "h01-1-0", "name": "search_documents", "observation": {"ok": true, "mode": "hybrid", "hits": [{"doc_id": "D06", "version_date": "2026-02-10", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "知识产品星云导出FAQ", "topic": "星云导出", "scope": "星云企业版", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["知识产品星云导出FAQ", "正文"], "token_count": 54, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D06-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D06_知识产品星云导出FAQ.md", "sha256": "8bd9082bfec18a6fea3a5ab443c22c0742c05745f2eab4efaf59ba5203e15437", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "普通成员需要导出时，应联系本空间管理员；本文不涉及其他产品。", "rrf_score": 0.032787, "bm25_score": 24.446926, "vector_score": 0.690987}, {"doc_id": "D06", "version_date": "2026-02-10", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "知识产品星云导出FAQ", "topic": "星云导出", "scope": "星云企业版", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["知识产品星云导出FAQ", "正文"], "token_count": 65, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D06-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/markdown/D06_知识产品星云导出FAQ.md", "sha256": "8bd9082bfec18a6fea3a5ab443c22c0742c05745f2eab4efaf59ba5203e15437", "method": "markdown", "page": null, "bbox": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "星云企业版支持将检索结果导出为CSV。单次导出最多10000条记录，仅空间管理员具有导出权限。", "rrf_score": 0.032258, "bm25_score": 17.314889, "vector_score": 0.641424}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c007", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r007", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第七节 确认网络与业务访问"], "token_count": 221, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 426.6171875, 191.75, 438.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 453.4765625, 546.75, 481.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 497.4765625, 546.75, 525.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第七节 确认网络与业务访问\n\nVPN显示已连接但目标系统无法打开时，应记录目标系统名称、错误提示和发生时间。可以区分为网页无法访问、页面能够打开但登录失败、登录后缺少某项业务功能等不同现象，便于确认网络和业务权限问题。\n\n不应把“没有导出权限”等业务角色限制理解为VPN故障。例如某产品功能仅管理员可用时，网络连通并不能替代角色授权。相关产品权限应查阅对应产品", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 6.161599, "vector_score": 0.414781}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c012", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r012", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十二条 权限和故障"], "token_count": 129, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 157.25, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 654.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十二条 权限和故障\n\n系统无法上传附件或提交单据时，应记录发生时间、错误提示及申请单号，向内部服务渠道反馈。不要提供账号密码或验证码。技术故障本身不构成延期批准；本文没有规定故障期间的线下替代入口和期限豁免。", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.411191, "vector_score": 0.428542}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十三条 代付与分摊示例"], "token_count": 222, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 180.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十三条 代付与分摊示例\n\n员工甲为同一项目的三名成员代付交通费用时，应在申请中列出同行人员、出行事项、实际支付金额和分摊说明。同行人员不应再次按相同凭据申报。若部分行程属于个人安排，应明确个人承担部分，不能将其隐藏在项目合计金额中。\n\n一个订单含两个项目的支出时，应说明分摊口径并由相应业务负责人确认。本文未规定必须按人数、时间或项目预算比例分摊，不能为了方", "rrf_score": 0.015385, "bm25_score": 3.043348, "vector_score": 0.355698}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c016", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r016", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十六条仍需补充的资料"], "token_count": 149, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 581.84580078125, 179.3568115234375, 594.153271484375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990662444721569}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.3772705078125, 608.582666015625, 540.60849609375, 654.841748046875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998898540405517}], "snippet": "第十六条仍需补充的资料\n\n现有扫描资料缺少适用部门、正式批准状态、制度优先级、起算细则、补正对期限的影响、超期审批权限及支付时限。即使扫描内容能够完整识别，也不代表这些缺口已经补齐。资料管理方需要提供相应依据后，才能对具体争议给出确定处理意见。", "rrf_score": 0.015152, "bm25_score": 2.300859, "vector_score": 0.366285}]}}
